# Vercel upload excludes. `vercel deploy --archive=tgz` tars the working tree
# and does NOT fully apply .gitignore, so the ~7 GB of nested .next build
# output ballooned the archive to ~1 GB per deploy. These are all REBUILT on
# Vercel (install + next build), so excluding them is safe and cuts the upload
# to source-only (~40 MB).
#
# NOTE: deliberately does NOT exclude `dist/` — some @borjie/* workspace
# packages resolve their entrypoint through a built `dist/`, and Vercel runs a
# scoped `next build` that may not rebuild every dep first. Keep dist in.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.blob
.git
*.log
